<title>USA: Beaverton SD 48J, Ore. $22 mln won by Key Capital.</title>
<headline>Beaverton SD 48J, Ore. $22 mln won by Key Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Key Capital said it won $22 million of Beaverton SD 48J, Ore., general obligation bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 5.4001 percent.</p>
